{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e5dacbe0696bc827e23a26c2a79e7e13e4203387770293b73d7d5998ccc9e99f", "ja": "（今日は原宿のグルメ&オシャレスポットで撮影だ。\n美希もノリノリで、かなり順調に進んでいる）", "zh": "（今天是原宿美食＆时尚景点的拍摄工作。\n美希的兴致也很高昂，进行得相当顺利。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "7046e685a41423939e8ab3c47032862627da78dfe9237f951fed201490797a3c", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまなの。\nちょっと早いけど休憩もらっちゃった。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦你了唷。\n虽然还有点早，美希先休息了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0185f4859a27eed45877cbc758f9de1cd444c9a2c0e453b1b4ce99fef25208ad", "ja": "リテイクが少ないからな。俺もカメラマンさんと\nチェックしてるけど、一発OKも多いし。", "zh": "毕竟不太需要重拍嘛。\n而且我也有跟摄影师检查，很多张都是一次OK。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "51192968f26972b7bd9aa7d334f03703d444737710a13b5571897baa7bad5ddf", "ja": "そう？　でもミキ、いつも通りだよ？", "zh": "是吗？可是美希都跟平常一样啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8a758d49aa92c5657aa3ff8584791450d50dee718e7fd042abf9177c818e1d21", "ja": "自然体なのは美希の長所だけど……そうだな、\n今日は特にそのよさが前面に出てるんだろう。", "zh": "表现自然就是美希的优点啊……\n然后，今天这个优点更是发挥得淋漓尽致呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "91b05ab6b56d592e2a62d808ff174cedb01705d043ecd84eadc5545327df53fc", "ja": "ふーん。でも確かに、今日はおいしい物いっぱい\n食べられたし、ミキ、結構楽しんでるかも♪", "zh": "是喔。不过今天的确吃了很多好吃的东西，\n美希可能真的很享受吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1006_p", "source_sha256": "762ab42c01bca655ff07be208d0ca75799203f4c5dbcf3812e4d65392b43a5c1", "ja": "午前中に撮影したやつか。確かにおいしそうに\n食べてたよな……撮影用なのに、一個も残さず。", "zh": "是指早上拍摄的时候吗？那时你的确吃得很开心呢……\n明明是拍摄用的道具，结果你一个不剩地都吃完了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "e7d5b2ca8464631364644b0b8cc6f18e8600fc5e61d12947aa6ec662916aff0d", "ja": "友達と原宿きた時はいつも食べるやつだもん。\nそれに、残すのなんてもったいないって思うな。", "zh": "因为那是美希跟朋友来原宿时都会吃的东西嘛。\n而且美希觉得，要是没吃完就太浪费了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1008_p", "source_sha256": "57ff1f6e23c0426d585c10d2077b1d1c551f0114ea0832c6714cd201474c7066", "ja": "原宿は美希のホームグラウンドってわけか。\nだから調子がいいのかもな。", "zh": "也就是说原宿是美希的主场啊。\n或许就是因为这样，今天的状况才会这么好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "261b4c02edc483a3fab50a73eb0ef7ce77402bc970084303ff2513a17f441a2c", "ja": "そうかも。だってお仕事っていうより、\n{$P$}とデートしてるみたいだし♪", "zh": "或许吧。毕竟与其说这是工作，\n反而比较像在跟{$P$}约会呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d383ec35a7c3a2f6b16dcbbffc2a250883c164a6ec18cafc0bd96b7ea8b8d595", "ja": "デートかはともかく……楽しんでもらえてよかった。\nやっぱり、美希に任せて正解だったな。", "zh": "无论是不是约会……只要你开心就好了。\n果然，交给美希是正确的决定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "df979c3c7f33f4d567564a1a426724c7e11b507dd794959d44525bd8c0734080", "ja": "え？　今日のお仕事、{$P$}が\nミキのこと選んでくれたの？", "zh": "咦？今天的工作，是{$P$}\n决定让美希来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d509d88aeb8358d82bd2ba772fbd096ae7aef9b4edae5e63c5698e4821a1b77d", "ja": "もちろん、先方からも候補は出されたけど、\nイメージ的に美希しかいないって思ったんだ。", "zh": "当然，客户那里列出的人选中也有你，\n不过我觉得在形象上，只有美希最符合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "420461ed88586556db781ccc3fba2e31f8d3ec4655be014ad8e9f8584f1c4f27", "ja": "そうなんだ！　えへへっ♪　\nなんだかとっても嬉しいかも！", "zh": "原来如此！嘿嘿♪\n总觉得挺开心的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1014_camman", "source_sha256": "bc247ff26e994b96e91560d67852112697f3a7fae6c2d4cce36e2d785efcc69f", "ja": "スミマセーン、そろそろ次行っていいですかー？", "zh": "不好意思，可以继续下个阶段的拍摄吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "59b8d6a83acabe899e898333619e0a4557e3a70bafd269b0905625bad1b18ca5", "ja": "ハーイ！　今行きますなのー！", "zh": "好～！马上去唷～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "ca17b5645c7d3d13f407019ba0c10c39fe13570e5544ff28fc933de9e279a78c", "ja": "じゃあミキ、行ってくるね。やる気出たから、\n午後はもっとスゴいの、期待してて♪", "zh": "那美希先去工作了。美希现在浑身充满干劲，\n所以下午的表现会更棒的，好好期待吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "e0696b971172154d7fd5a6fccc639ecfdebf068e450691511a3983207f0bb9d0", "ja": "あ……それと{$P$}。\nミキね、お願いがあるんだけど～。", "zh": "啊……对了，{$P$}。\n美希有件事想拜托你～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1018_p", "source_sha256": "aa9218ad3d19ae39d575e33d88f005a65c3b0d1aa854a58d6aea56159f6bc145", "ja": "ん？　……ああ、おにぎりだよな？\n甘い物の後は、塩気が欲しくなるし。", "zh": "嗯？喔……我知道了，是饭团对吧？\n毕竟吃完甜食后，都会想吃点咸的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0124_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "518b474b48f74260ef28d0d5a5bd446f2649a7813571952bd39a41933c73d000", "ja": "うんっ！　やっぱりミキのことは、\nハニーにお任せなの♪　あはっ☆", "zh": "嗯！果然美希的事\n交给HONEY就好了唷♪啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
